{"id":"029fc1f5fb08","path":"/de/university/where-to-find-us","lang":"de","title":"Standorte – die Campus der USI","description":"Die USI verfügt über vier Standorte: Campus West Lugano – Hauptsitz – Via Buffi 13, Lugano Campus Ost Lugano – Via La Santa 1, Lugano Campus Mendrisio – Largo Bernasconi 2, Mendrisio Campus Bellinzona – Via Francesco Chiesa 5, Bellinzona Die USI ist zudem in Airolo vertreten, mit der Casa della…","section":"University","crumbs":["Universität"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-usi-corporate-ccrz-2016-lugano-vita-campus-47-web-tile-campus.jpg?itok=vBVRghON","words":90,"alternates":{"en":"/en/university/where-to-find-us","it":"/it/universita/dove-siamo","de":"/de/university/where-to-find-us"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Startseite","path":"/en"},{"label":"Universität","path":"/en/university"},{"label":"Standorte – die Campus der USI","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"kind":"video","youtube":"ol9yOSgI4VY","caption":"Campus-Tour"}]},{"t":"html","html":"<p>Die USI hat vier Campus:</p> <ul> <li><strong>Campus West Lugano</strong> – Hauptsitz – Via Buffi 13, Lugano</li> <li><strong>Campus Ost Lugano</strong> – Via La Santa 1, Lugano</li> <li><strong>Campus Mendrisio</strong> – Largo Bernasconi 2, Mendrisio</li> <li><strong>Campus Bellinzona</strong> – Via Francesco Chiesa 5, Bellinzona</li> </ul> <p>Die USI ist zudem in Airolo mit der Casa della sostenibilità vertreten, in Balerna mit dem Archivio del Moderno, in Locarno mit dem Lehrstuhl «Locarno Film Festival Professor for the Future of Cinema and Audiovisual Arts» und dem der USI angegliederten IRSOL sowie in Lugano-Cadro mit L’ideatorio.</p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Entdecken Sie unsere Campus"},{"t":"cards","items":[{"title":"Campus West Lugano","href":"/en/university/where-to-find-us/lugano-west-campus","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-usi-corporate-ccrz-2016-lugano-vita-campus-47-web-tile-campus.jpg?itok=vBVRghON"},{"title":"Campus Ost Lugano","href":"/en/university/where-to-find-us/lugano-east-campus","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-campus-est-dauria-2023-esterno-17-web-tile.jpg?itok=XyFTu-tI"},{"title":"Campus Mendrisio","href":"https://www.arc.usi.ch/en/academy-architecture/campus","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-usi-corporate-ccrz-2016-mendrisio-architettura-16-web-tile-campus.jpg?itok=_OFXjjqy"},{"title":"Campus Bellinzona","href":"/en/university/where-to-find-us/bellinzona-campus","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-campus-bellinzona-01-web-tile.jpg?itok=5z_OANeR"},{"title":"Kongresslokal","href":"/en/university/where-to-find-us/congress-venue","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-aula-magna-usi-01-web-tile.jpg?itok=sUZzj1nj"}]}],"ctas":[],"nav":[],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/where-to-find-us","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T14:59:01.538Z","translated":true}